# Portfolio: Secure AWS S3 Bucket Configuration

## 1. Project Overview
**Title:** Secure AWS S3 Bucket Setup  
**Objective:**  
Demonstrate the creation and configuration of a secure AWS S3 bucket with:  
- Public access blocked  
- Server-side encryption (SSE-S3 / SSE-KMS)  
- Bucket policies restricting access  
- Object versioning to protect against accidental deletion  
- Lifecycle rules for cost optimization  
- Testing via AWS CLI  

## 2. Steps Taken

### Step 1: Create S3 Bucket
```bash
aws s3api create-bucket \
  --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket \
  --region eu-west-2 \
  --create-bucket-configuration LocationConstraint=eu-west-2

aws s3api put-public-access-block \
  --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket \
  --public-access-block-configuration \
    "BlockPublicAcls=true,IgnorePublicAcls=true,BlockPublicPolicy=true,RestrictPublicBuckets=true"

aws s3api put-bucket-encryption \
  --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket \
  --server-side-encryption-configuration '{
    "Rules": [
      {
        "ApplyServerSideEncryptionByDefault": {
          "SSEAlgorithm": "AES256"
        }
      }
    ]
  }'
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "AllowFullAccessForNabbofcr8tv",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "AWS": "arn:aws:iam::022499011653:user/Nabbofcr8tv"
      },
      "Action": [
        "s3:ListBucket",
        "s3:GetBucketLocation"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::77sevencr8tvsecurebucket"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "AllowObjectActionsForNabbofcr8tv",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {
        "AWS": "arn:aws:iam::022499011653:user/Nabbofcr8tv"
      },
      "Action": [
        "s3:GetObject",
        "s3:PutObject",
        "s3:DeleteObject",
        "s3:GetObjectVersion",
        "s3:DeleteObjectVersion"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::77sevencr8tvsecurebucket/*"
    }
  ]
}
aws s3api put-bucket-versioning \
  --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket \
  --versioning-configuration Status=Enabled
aws s3api put-bucket-lifecycle-configuration \
  --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket \
  --lifecycle-configuration '{
    "Rules": [
      {
        "ID": "TransitionAndExpire",
        "Status": "Enabled",
        "Prefix": "",
        "Transitions": [
          {
            "Days": 30,
            "StorageClass": "STANDARD_IA"
          }
        ],
        "Expiration": {
          "Days": 365
        }
      }
    ]
  }'
echo "Hello secure bucket" > test.txt
aws s3 cp test.txt s3://77sevencr8tvsecurebucket/
aws s3api list-object-versions --bucket 77sevencr8tvsecurebucket
aws s3 cp s3://77sevencr8tvsecurebucket/test.txt .


